00:01:34,736 --> 00:01:40,736
Spider-Man: All Roads Lead to No Way Home is a
documentary film directed by None.

2
00:03:09,473 --> 00:03:15,473
JB Smoove and Martin Starr host a celebration of 20 years of "Spider-Man" movies, from
the Sam Raimi trilogy to Marc Webb's movies and the trio from Jon Watts.

3
00:04:44,210 --> 00:04:50,210
Self, played by Tom Holland.

4
00:06:18,947 --> 00:06:24,947
Self, played by Andrew Garfield.

5
00:07:53,684 --> 00:07:59,684
Self, played by Tobey Maguire.

6
00:09:28,421 --> 00:09:34,421
Self, played by Willem Dafoe.

7
00:11:03,157 --> 00:11:09,157
Self, played by Alfred Molina.

8
00:12:37,894 --> 00:12:43,894
Self, played by Jamie Foxx.

9
00:14:12,631 --> 00:14:18,631
Spider-Man: Brand New Day is an upcoming American superhero film based on the Marvel Comics character Spider-Man,
co-produced by Columbia Pictures and Marvel Studios, and distributed by Sony Pictures Releasing.

10
00:15:47,368 --> 00:15:53,368
It is intended to be the 38th film in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) and the fourth film
in the MCU Spider-Man film series following Spider-Man: No Way Home (2021).

11
00:17:22,105 --> 00:17:28,105
The film is being directed by Destin Daniel Cretton from a
screenplay by Chris McKenna and Erik Sommers.

12
00:18:56,842 --> 00:19:02,842
Tom Holland stars as Peter Parker / Spider-Man alongside Zendaya, Jacob Batalon, Sadie Sink, Liza
Colón-Zayas, Jon Bernthal, Mark Ruffalo, Michael Mando, Tramell Tillman, and Marvin Jones III.

13
00:20:31,578 --> 00:20:37,578
Sony was developing a fourth MCU Spider-Man film by
August 2019 alongside No Way Home.

14
00:22:06,315 --> 00:22:12,315
Producer Amy Pascal revealed in November 2021 that it was intended to be the first in a new trilogy
of Holland-led Spider-Man films, with work on the story beginning that December.

15
00:23:41,052 --> 00:23:47,052
McKenna and Sommers returned as writers from the previous films by February 2023, Cretton was
hired to direct by October 2024, and the title was announced in March 2025.

16
00:25:15,789 --> 00:25:21,789
Filming began in August 2025 with location filming in Glasgow, Scotland,
while soundstage work occurred at Pinewood Studios in England.

17
00:26:50,526 --> 00:26:56,526
Additional location work occurred throughout
England, and filming wrapped in December.

18
00:28:25,263 --> 00:28:31,263
Spider-Man: Brand New Day is scheduled to be released in the United
States on July 31, 2026, as part of Phase Six of the MCU.
